WEBVTT

00:09:30.958 --> 00:09:32.500
"I like the good vibes."

00:09:34.125 --> 00:09:36.500
"Best communities are on Twitch."

00:09:37.292 --> 00:09:38.583
(Laughter)

00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:41.792
"They get us through
the rough patches in life."

00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:45.601
Oh, that's a message
I definitely see a lot on Twitch,

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:46.917
which is very good.

00:09:47.625 --> 00:09:49.226
"A very positive community,"

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.726
"a lot of positivity,"

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.101
which is pretty great.

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:57.351
ES: So Cohh, before I get back
to my TED talk,

00:09:57.375 --> 00:10:00.559
which I actually should probably
get back to doing at some point --